WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,540
The monsters of the four seasons are indeed extraordinary

2
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:13,140
Last time we played against Rocket Evil Fish, luck accounted for the majority.

3
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:16,800
Snow Witch, thank you for your hard work. Come back and rest.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,440
There was quite a commotion just now, and it will probably attract a lot of trouble.

5
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,840
Hurry up and put the materials away and leave.

6
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,240
It is not advisable to stay here for a long time

7
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:32,080
Ah Lei, there are so many giant spiders

8
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,880
Has anyone met the Pearl Emperor?

9
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,480
The Pearl Emperor is the first of four seasons

10
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:37,700
How could we survive when we met?

11
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,420
It’s not enough to fill the gaps between Pearl Emperor’s teeth.

12
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:42,020
One of us killed the Pearl Emperor among the spiders and escaped.

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,820
This person is too scary. You must not meet him.

14
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:45,020
Were you scared away?

15
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,620
Shut him down

16
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,920
This bamboo silk is also an object that came out of the Lingshou sword bone of Wang Shang in the Three Tribulations.

17
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,520
Let's cut off the remaining bamboo shreds

18
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,520
The horse flows away
